{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 3, :comments ["<b>And you shall make a fire-offering.</b> This is not a commandment, but rather: when you come there and it arises upon your heart to make a fire-offering to HaShem —" "<b>For a vow or for a freewill offering, etc.</b> Or that you make the fire-offering for the obligation of your fixed festivals, which I have obligated you to make on the festival:" "<b>A pleasing fragrance.</b> Contentment before Me."], :book :numbers, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 15, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:10:58.320043963Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}